  "description": "Stay Strong's refined V5 frame. The ultimate aluminium BMX race frame. This is the Expert (19.5” Top tube) frame and features a 1-1/8th head tube, Euro bottom bracket and 10mm enclosed dropouts for for Disc brakes and a 22.2mm seat tube all allowing you to run the very best and modern conponentry. The frame is a refinement of Stay Strong's race winning aluminium frame design. The main addition to the V5 is a stiffer and stronger down tube, allowing a \"Pro\" size look and feel but without compromising on the weight or design. Stay Strong really push the boundaries with aesthetics and the V5 is no exception; All the colours feature a slick two tone pain finish mixing premium paint choices at the front with a classy matt finish at the rear. The water graphics have been updated too with \"Stay Strong Code\" which features tons of hidden messages throughout the design. The For Life V5 from Stay Strong is one of the best performing and looking BMX race frames out there. ###section### Product Specs\nMATERIALAluminium\n\nTOP TUBE LENGTH19.5\"\n\nHEAD TUBE ANGLE73°\n\nSEAT TUBE ANGLE\n\nCHAIN STAY LENGTH13.3\" - 14.3\"\n\nBB HEIGHT269.2mm\n\nWHEEL SIZE20\"\n\nSTANDOVER HEIGHT\n\nDROPOUT SIZE10mm\n\nHEADSET TYPEIntegrated\n\nBB TYPEEuro\n\nSEAT TUBE DIAMETER\n\nBRAKE MOUNTSDisc\n\nWEIGHT1232g (2.71lbs)\n###section### Product Highlights BMX Racing specific geometry Race specific frame Strong and lightweight aluminium construction Butted tubing for added strength Integrated chain tensioners",
